  "description": "A summer special short story that unfolds in the background of a hot summer. \n\nContents:\n\n1-5. **Isegye Harem Yongsa** (이세계 하렘 용사, This World's Harem Knight) \\[ero404\\]\n6-10. **#Dongmil#Yeoreum#Cheotsarang** (#농밀#여름#첮사랑, #Dense#Summer#Firstlove) \\[Shampoo\\]\n11-15. **Pyega Eseoui Harutbam** (폐가 에서의 하룻밤, A Night at the Ruins) \\[Daljakja\\]\n16-20. **Eeokeon Jom Gochyeojwo!** (에어컨 좀 고쳐줘!, Please Fix the AC!) \\[Sin Yu-Ri\\]\n21-25. **Hanyeoreumbamui Angmong** (한여름밤의 악몽, A Midsummer's Nightmare) \\[Sin Yu-Ri\\]\n26-30. **Geu Yeoreum Narui Chueok** (그 여름 날의 추억, The Memories of That Summer Day) \\[Dongjijigi\\]\n31-36. **Paradise CLUB** (파라다이스 CLUB) \\[ttwook x Maneul\\]\n37-42. **Yeoreum Sonagi** (여름 소나기) \\[SSAEM x Ohagi\\]\n\n*Note: Includes eight extra chapters.*",
